<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MedImmune started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MedImmune started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of MedImmune Inc with near- and long-term accumulate ratings.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one to 14-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
